'' sizeof( ustring * N ) -- N UTF-16 units, and the offsets of what follows one.
''
'' Checked against fbc, which spells the field 'uint16 U[2]' and asserts
'' sizeof( Mixed ) == 12. tiko-lang gave Cell a sizeof of 96 -- four 24-byte USTRING
'' DESCRIPTORS -- so every object holding one was twelve times too big and every field
'' after it sat at the wrong offset. It lowered and it verified.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-udt tests/types/src/fixed-ustring.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: cell size 8 align 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: mixed size 12 align 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: mixed off u 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: mixed off after_ 8
